  "title": "Smackdown Stealth Gray",
  "description": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Seaguar Smackdown Lo-Vis Stealth Gray 8-Strand Performance Braid — Thinner Diameter, No Stretch, Ultra Strong and Abrasion Resistant, “Super Sensitive“, Less Visible.</strong><br></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Made with 8 ultra-thin, micro-weave strands, woven into a perfectly round profile for quiet laser-like casts.</span></p>\n<p><span>One of the thinnest-diameter braids available for extra sensitivity - so thin that 20 lb test has the diameter of 6 lb monofilament.</span></p>\n<p><span>Provides exceptional knot and tensile strength with unparalleled abrasion resistance.</span></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Low Visibility Stealth Gray reduces line visibility, making presentations more natural.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/6548/5531/files/Prop65-warning_v3_550.png?v=1780670841\" alt=\"\"></p>",
